[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_1l050")
dialogue_id = "mq_4_40_begin"
record_title = "Era 四: The Scribe Returns"
text = "PAGE: explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), historian(STUDIO_PRIMARY)
explorer: Here's the latest report from the scholars.
explorer: They seemed excited.
historian: Yes...
historian: This...
historian: Oh my, this is more than I expected.
historian: With these notes I can already start translating the more recent texts.
historian: And those should help me decipher the ancient ones.
historian: I wish we had started this project sooner!

PAGE: scribe(CONVERSATION), historian(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), avatar_adult(PEERING)
scribe: There will be no need to scrape bits of wisdom from the old texts anymore, Historian.
historian: Scribe!
historian: You finally returned.
historian: And you've brought a guest too?
scribe: This is no guest.
scribe: You look upon the Avatar of the Enlightened One, returned to guide us.

PAGE: avatar_adult(PEERING), historian(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(CONVERSATION)
avatar_adult: It is an honor to meet you, Historian.
avatar_adult: Father has spoken often of your dedication to preserving our memories.
historian: Welcome to our little haven.
historian: But \"father\"?
historian: The Scribe can't possibly be your father...
avatar_adult: He is the one who raised me.
avatar_adult: Helped the divine spirit within me blossom.
historian: Excuse my theologic inexperience, but are you claiming to be the Enlightened One?
avatar_adult: No, I am an ordinary mortal.
avatar_adult: But the Enlightened One's spirit within me guides my actions.
avatar_adult: Inspires in me the knowledge of what is right.

PAGE: scribe(CONVERSATION), historian(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), avatar_adult(PEERING)
scribe: The Avatar carries the wisdom of the ages, from long before the Shattering.
scribe: Once we all follow this divine mandate, the world will be reunified once more.
historian: Our ancestors followed the mandate, and their prayers and magic rituals never got them anywhere.
historian: We should learn from their mistakes, not try to repeat them.
scribe: It is different now.
scribe: The Reunification has already begun.
scribe: The shard holding the Enlightened One's Abode has had its neighbor join it.
scribe: It is what signaled the Enlightened One's rebirth.
historian: You keep going on about Reunification.
historian: It's a dream.
historian: We must work with what we have.
historian: Find ways to live in the New World.
scribe: The people are tired of accepting this fate, Historian.
scribe: They do not want to struggle for the next harvest knowing that the world will remain doomed.
scribe: They want hope.
scribe: I will summon envoys from the shards.
scribe: Once the people hear of the Enlightened One's rebirth, they will rally behind us.
historian: Very well.
historian: I will address these envoys as well.
historian: Let everyone decide for themself if they want to build a future based on reality or continue to follow a pointless dream."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
